### AWD inventory
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/awd/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"maxResults":"25","details":"SHOW"}}

### Create inbound order
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/awd/inbound-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{}}

### Get inbound order
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/awd/inbound-orders/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","resourceId":"ORDER-1"}

### List outbound orders
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/awd/outbound-orders/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"maxResults":"25"}}

### Create replenishment order
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/awd/replenishment-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{}}
